---
import { site } from "@/data/site"
import Layout from "@/layouts/main.astro"
---

<Layout title="Privacy" description="How Ambivalent Co. handles Hena waitlist information.">
  <header class="legal-header">
    <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Hena home">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">H</span>
      <span>Hena</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
  </header>
  <main id="main-content" class="legal-page">
    <p class="kicker"><span>Legal</span> Last updated September 7, 2026</p>
    <h1>Privacy at Hena.</h1>
    <p class="legal-intro">
      Ambivalent Co. operates Hena and hena.dev. This notice explains the information we collect
      for the Hena waitlist and how you can control it.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you join the waitlist, we collect the email address you submit, your consent version,
        subscription status, and timestamps related to registration or unsubscription. Cloudflare
        Turnstile also processes technical information needed to distinguish people from automated
        abuse. We do not ask for your name, company, or payment information.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your email only to confirm registration and send meaningful Hena beta and launch
        updates. We do not sell your information or use the waitlist for third-party advertising.
        We also use registration information for internal operational notifications.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        Cloudflare hosts this site, protects the form with Turnstile, stores waitlist records in D1,
        and provides privacy-focused aggregate analytics. Resend delivers registration and launch
        emails. These providers process information on our behalf under their own security and
        privacy commitments.
      </p>
      <p>
        When internal signup notifications are enabled, we send your full email address,
        registration timestamp, and whether you are joining or rejoining to Discord in a
        restricted-access operations channel. Discord processes that information to deliver
        and store these notifications. We do not include your unsubscribe token or IP address.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Retention and deletion</h2>
      <p>
        We keep waitlist records for as long as needed to provide beta and launch updates. You may
        unsubscribe through the link in any email. To request deletion of the record itself, email
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. We may retain minimal records when
        required to honor an unsubscribe request or meet legal obligations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Joining is optional. You can unsubscribe at any time without affecting access to the public
        website or open-source software. You may also ask to access, correct, or delete your
        waitlist information by contacting us.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Ambivalent Co.<br />
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
